  "connectors.detail.baidu-drive.description": "Connect Baidu Netdisk to read and analyze documents, images, videos, and other assets you authorize. Turn them into MiniMax Design creative briefs, scripts, storyboards, and visual references, then save the results back to your drive. Access is limited to My Application Data/bdpan, with support for uploading, downloading, searching, and sharing files. Assets from other folders can be saved into this directory through shared links.",
